:: Chef Opening Bailey Assure
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"I-I'm not going to say anything bad," you say. "T-The orphanage is my home..."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"Relax. I'm not going to say anything about the orphanage," you shrug. "I live there, don't I?"
<<else>>
	"I won't say anything bad," you say. "Today isn't about you or the orphanage."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $bailey_dom lte 30>>
	Bailey's smile goes tight before <<he>> smooths <<his>> face out. "We'll see about that."
<<elseif $bailey_dom gte 70>>
	Bailey's smile looks warm and real. "I know."
<<else>>
	Bailey's smile stays perfectly fake. <<He>> says nothing.
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey looks away from you. You realise that, for the first time since your arrival, you're no longer the centre of attention.
<br><br>

<<link [[Look|Chef Opening 7]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>


:: Chef Opening Praise
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
<<npc Bailey 1>><<person1>>

You look around the room. Bailey stares back. <<if $bailey_dom lte 30>><<His>> gaze flickers between you and Quinn.<</if>> You put on your best smile and begin.
<br><br>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	You talk about the youth ward where you grew up. About what it was like growing up alongside Robin. About Bailey's workers keeping you safe. About your fellow orphans who work harder than anyone you've ever met. About how Bailey taught you the value of hard work.
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	You talk about the youth ward where you grew up. About learning what hard work and discipline looked like before you were old enough to understand what it even was. About how, in the end, Bailey prepared you for exactly this.
<<else>>
	You talk about the youth ward where you grew up. About Robin. About Bailey. About what the Bailey orphanage gave you and taught you, even when you didn't want it.
<</if>>
<br><br>

The audience listens in quiet admiration. Some wipe tears from their eyes. Others look unconvinced.
<br><br>

The employee you recognise from the orphanage has gone pale, refusing to meet your gaze. <<stress 12>><<trauma 6>><<ggstress>><<gtrauma>>
<br><br>

<<if $chef_gwylan>>
	<<npc Gwylan 2>><<person2>>You catch Gwylan's eye on the second floor. <<He>> is smiling. Something flickers beneath the surface of <<his>> face. It's there and gone, faster than you could identify it.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<npc Quinn 3>><<person3>>Quinn smiles and nods along. <<He>> looks like someone watching things go exactly as planned.
<br><br>

<<if $chef_avery>>
	<<npc Avery 4>><<person4>>Avery is the only one not applauding, glass of whisky untouched. <<He>>'s looking right at Bailey.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<person1>>
You dare a glance at Bailey as you leave the podium. <<He>> is still looking at you<<if $bailey_dom gte 70>>, wearing a disarming smile that almost looks real.<<else>>. <<His>> expression gives nothing away.<</if>><<npcincr Bailey love 2>><<set $bailey_love += 2>><<npcincr Bailey dom 1>><<set $bailey_dom += 1>><<set $stockholm_bailey to ($stockholm_bailey || 0) + 1>><<set $stockholm_points to ($stockholm_points || {})>><<set $stockholm_points.cafe to true>><<gglove "Bailey">><<gdom "Bailey">><<gbaileystock>>
<br><br>

The party begins in earnest. What do you want to do?
<br><br>

<<endevent>>
<<chefspeechoptions>>


:: Chef Opening Praise End
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

The party winds down after a few hours. You head to the exit, but Bailey intercepts you.
<br><br>

<<He>> steps close. <<His>> hand finds the back of your neck.
<br><br>

<<if $bailey_dom lte 30>>
	"So that head of yours isn't just for show. Good," <<he>> says with a sneer. The words are just for you. "Rent's still due, brat."
<<elseif $bailey_dom gte 70>>
	"Useful, aren't you?" <<he>> says, <<his>> voice low enough only you can hear. "Rent's still due."
<<else>>
	"Don't get any ideas," <<he>> says quietly, so only you can hear. "Rent's still due."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<He>> squeezes your neck once before releasing you and walking away.<<npcincr Bailey dom 1>><<set $bailey_dom += 1>><<gdom "Bailey">>
<br><br>

<<npc Sam 2>><<person2>>
Sam catches you at the exit. "I forgot to mention," <<he>> says. "We're bumping up the price of buns to <<printprice 15000>>.
<<set $bun_value to 15000>>
It's expensive, but they're worth it. And we have extra staff to pay."
<br><br>
<<He>> waves you goodbye, and you exit onto Cliff Street.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Cliff Street]]>><<endevent>><<unset $chef_gwylan>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<br>
